{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t天文台在早上6時45分，發出酷熱天氣警告，提醒市民慎防中暑。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n天文台預測今日大致天晴，日間市區最高氣溫約33度，新界再高兩三度，部分地區極端酷熱。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：許敬軒\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T23:20:18.880689+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":80,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T22:51:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T01:57:52.628288+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T23:18:09.890377+00:00","content_hash":"552be4e01504e7488ada9a9f7590da98702090767ef5f628314ddec2cd0ceae5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}